# Minigame Tweaks #

# I'm using this RPY as a way to house all the "tweaks" I wanted to make to minigames
# Currently only houses one major tweak for now, will be exapnded upon at a later date 

# 12/03/25 Added multi-racer support system
# 18/03/25 Fixed progression bug by splitting normal race from multi-race mode
# 22/03/25 Rewrote unlock system to be per-character instead of global

####################
# Override Cleanup #
####################
